  them determines whether the two-agent counterexample exists.
  Coherence is therefore architectural, not logical.

  Real-world precedent (Remark 9.5): ICAO amendment of Nov. 2003
  gives TCAS resolution advisories precedence over conflicting ATC
  instructions - an A_safe-type axiom adopted after Uberlingen.
